          "start_seconds": 0.0,
          "end_seconds": 10.5,
          "duration_seconds": 10.5,
          "text": "Low-angle shot through drifting smoke and rubble across the stone floor, tilting up as polished boots step over splintered wood, revealing an imposing nobleman in a gold-embroidered navy coat.",
          "source_line": 14
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_002",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "action",
          "label": "ACTION",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:01.00",
          "end": "00:10.50",
          "start_seconds": 1.0,
          "end_seconds": 10.5,
          "duration_seconds": 9.5,
          "text": "Alexander strides deliberately through the pulverized cathedral doorway. Dressed in the regal ducal coat with gold braided cuffs and a lion crest, his scarred face is set with cold, unyielding authority.",
          "source_line": 18
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_003",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Shocked, Trembling)",
          "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
          "delivery": "Shocked, Trembling",
          "start": "00:11.20",
          "end": "00:12.60",
          "start_seconds": 11.2,
          "end_seconds": 12.6,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4,
          "text": "Who are you?",
          "source_line": 22
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_004",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER (Low, Resonant)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
          "delivery": "Low, Resonant",
          "start": "00:12.80",
          "end": "00:14.60",
          "start_seconds": 12.8,
          "end_seconds": 14.6,
          "duration_seconds": 1.8,
          "text": "You already know.",
          "source_line": 26
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_005",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:14.60",
          "end": "00:16.60",
          "start_seconds": 14.6,
          "end_seconds": 16.6,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0,
          "text": "Close-up on Juliana, her manacled hands clutching at her smock as tears well in her eyes.",
          "source_line": 30
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_006",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "JULIANA (Breathless, Tearful Whisper)",
          "speaker": "JULIANA",
          "delivery": "Breathless, Tearful Whisper",
          "start": "00:15.00",
          "end": "00:16.40",
          "start_seconds": 15.0,
          "end_seconds": 16.4,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4,
          "text": "Alexander...",
          "source_line": 34
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_007",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:16.60",
          "end": "00:17.90",
          "start_seconds": 16.6,
          "end_seconds": 17.9,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3,
          "text": "Close-up on Alexander, his gaze softening momentarily toward her.",
          "source_line": 38
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_008",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER (Gentle, Reassuring)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
          "delivery": "Gentle, Reassuring",
          "start": "00:16.80",
          "end": "00:17.90",
          "start_seconds": 16.8,
          "end_seconds": 17.9,
          "duration_seconds": 1.1,
          "text": "Juliana.",
          "source_line": 42
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_009",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:17.90",
          "end": "00:21.50",
          "start_seconds": 17.9,
          "end_seconds": 21.5,
          "duration_seconds": 3.6,
          "text": "Medium shot of Rupert descending the altar steps, furiously pointing toward Alexander.",
          "source_line": 46
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_010",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Furious, Hysterical)",
          "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
          "delivery": "Furious, Hysterical",
          "start": "00:18.00",
          "end": "00:21.20",
          "start_seconds": 18.0,
          "end_seconds": 21.2,
          "duration_seconds": 3.2,
          "text": "Guards! Arrest this imposter!",
          "source_line": 50
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_011",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:21.50",
          "end": "00:23.40",
          "start_seconds": 21.5,
          "end_seconds": 23.4,
          "duration_seconds": 1.9,
          "text": "Medium shot of the royal guardsman standing rigidly in red uniform and bearskin cap, resting his white-gloved hand on his sabre.",
          "source_line": 54
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_012",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ROYAL GUARD (Stoic, Defiant)",
          "speaker": "ROYAL GUARD",
          "delivery": "Stoic, Defiant",
          "start": "00:22.00",
          "end": "00:23.40",
          "start_seconds": 22.0,
          "end_seconds": 23.4,
          "duration_seconds": 1.4,
          "text": "We will not.",
          "source_line": 58
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_013",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:23.40",
          "end": "00:26.50",
          "start_seconds": 23.4,
          "end_seconds": 26.5,
          "duration_seconds": 3.1,
          "text": "Close-up on Rupert, veins bulging in his neck as his composure shatters.",
          "source_line": 62
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_014",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Screaming, Outraged)",
          "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
          "delivery": "Screaming, Outraged",
          "start": "00:23.50",
          "end": "00:25.20",
          "start_seconds": 23.5,
          "end_seconds": 25.2,
          "duration_seconds": 1.7,
          "text": "I said arrest him!",
          "source_line": 66
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_015",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Desperate, Unhinged)",
          "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
          "delivery": "Desperate, Unhinged",
          "start": "00:25.50",
          "end": "00:26.50",
          "start_seconds": 25.5,
          "end_seconds": 26.5,
          "duration_seconds": 1.0,
          "text": "Why?!",
          "source_line": 70
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_016",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:26.50",
          "end": "00:28.80",
          "start_seconds": 26.5,
          "end_seconds": 28.8,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3,
          "text": "Close-up on the Royal Guard holding his upright blade with unwavering conviction.",
          "source_line": 74
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_017",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ROYAL GUARD (Firm, Reverent)",
          "speaker": "ROYAL GUARD",
          "delivery": "Firm, Reverent",
          "start": "00:26.70",
          "end": "00:28.80",
          "start_seconds": 26.7,
          "end_seconds": 28.8,
          "duration_seconds": 2.1,
          "text": "Because we know who he is.",
          "source_line": 78
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_018",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:28.80",
          "end": "00:30.40",
          "start_seconds": 28.8,
          "end_seconds": 30.4,
          "duration_seconds": 1.6,
          "text": "Medium shot of Catherine clutching her father's arm, her bridal bouquet drooping as panic seizes her face.",
          "source_line": 82
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_019",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "CATHERINE (Trembling, Apprehensive)",
          "speaker": "CATHERINE",
          "delivery": "Trembling, Apprehensive",
          "start": "00:29.00",
          "end": "00:30.30",
          "start_seconds": 29.0,
          "end_seconds": 30.3,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3,
          "text": "Rupert...",
          "source_line": 86
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_020",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:30.40",
          "end": "00:33.80",
          "start_seconds": 30.4,
          "end_seconds": 33.8,
          "duration_seconds": 3.4,
          "text": "Medium close-up of Rupert gripping the edge of a pew for balance, his eyes wild with terror.",
          "source_line": 90
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_021",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Denial, Shaken)",
          "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
          "delivery": "Denial, Shaken",
          "start": "00:30.50",
          "end": "00:33.80",
          "start_seconds": 30.5,
          "end_seconds": 33.8,
          "duration_seconds": 3.3,
          "text": "You cannot be him. Alexander died!",
          "source_line": 94
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_022",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:33.80",
          "end": "00:39.90",
          "start_seconds": 33.8,
          "end_seconds": 39.9,
          "duration_seconds": 6.1,
          "text": "Wide tracking shot behind Alexander as he advances down the center aisle, silhouetted against the ruins of the cathedral nave.",
          "source_line": 98
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_023",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER (Cold, Commanding)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
          "delivery": "Cold, Commanding",
          "start": "00:34.00",
          "end": "00:39.80",
          "start_seconds": 34.0,
          "end_seconds": 39.8,
          "duration_seconds": 5.8,
          "text": "And yet, here I stand. That is the lie you built your life upon.",
          "source_line": 102
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_024",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:39.90",
          "end": "00:44.80",
          "start_seconds": 39.9,
          "end_seconds": 44.8,
          "duration_seconds": 4.9,
          "text": "Medium shot of an elderly silver-haired woman in simple ivory robes stepping into the aisle, her hands outstretched in trembling awe.",
          "source_line": 106
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_025",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER (Choked with Tears)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER",
          "delivery": "Choked with Tears",
          "start": "00:40.20",
          "end": "00:42.50",
          "start_seconds": 40.2,
          "end_seconds": 42.5,
          "duration_seconds": 2.3,
          "text": "Alexander...",
          "source_line": 110
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_026",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "action",
          "label": "ACTION",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:44.80",
          "end": "00:48.00",
          "start_seconds": 44.8,
          "end_seconds": 48.0,
          "duration_seconds": 3.2,
          "text": "Alexander halts his march as his mother reaches him, placing her frail hands gently upon his chest.",
          "source_line": 114
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_027",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER (Soft, Reverent)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
          "delivery": "Soft, Reverent",
          "start": "00:48.00",
          "end": "00:49.00",
          "start_seconds": 48.0,
          "end_seconds": 49.0,
          "duration_seconds": 1.0,
          "text": "Mother.",
          "source_line": 118
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_028",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "action",
          "label": "ACTION",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:49.00",
          "end": "00:54.00",
          "start_seconds": 49.0,
          "end_seconds": 54.0,
          "duration_seconds": 5.0,
          "text": "His mother gently cradles Alexander's scarred cheek, tears streaming down her face as guests in the background watch in stunned silence.",
          "source_line": 122
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_029",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER (Overcome, Loving)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER",
          "delivery": "Overcome, Loving",
          "start": "00:49.20",
          "end": "00:53.80",
          "start_seconds": 49.2,
          "end_seconds": 53.8,
          "duration_seconds": 4.6,
          "text": "Look at you... my beautiful boy.",
          "source_line": 126
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_030",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "00:54.00",
          "end": "01:03.50",
          "start_seconds": 54.0,
          "end_seconds": 63.5,
          "duration_seconds": 9.5,
          "text": "Medium two-shot framed down the ruined nave between Alexander and his mother.",
          "source_line": 130
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_031",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER (Tearful, Proud)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER",
          "delivery": "Tearful, Proud",
          "start": "00:54.00",
          "end": "01:01.80",
          "start_seconds": 54.0,
          "end_seconds": 61.8,
          "duration_seconds": 7.8,
          "text": "I saw you again... but seeing you like this... I see my son as he was always meant to be.",
          "source_line": 134
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_032",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER (Tender, Resolute)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
          "delivery": "Tender, Resolute",
          "start": "01:02.00",
          "end": "01:04.00",
          "start_seconds": 62.0,
          "end_seconds": 64.0,
          "duration_seconds": 2.0,
          "text": "I have come home, Mother.",
          "source_line": 138
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_033",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "action",
          "label": "ACTION",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "01:04.00",
          "end": "01:12.50",
          "start_seconds": 64.0,
          "end_seconds": 72.5,
          "duration_seconds": 8.5,
          "text": "Alexander's mother turns toward the gathered nobility and guards, raising her chin and pointing proudly toward Alexander.",
          "source_line": 142
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_034",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER (Ringing, Authoritative)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER'S MOTHER",
          "delivery": "Ringing, Authoritative",
          "start": "01:04.20",
          "end": "01:12.40",
          "start_seconds": 64.2,
          "end_seconds": 72.4,
          "duration_seconds": 8.2,
          "text": "Let everyone hear me! This is my son... Alexander Ashburn. The rightful Duke of Ashburn!",
          "source_line": 146
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_035",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "01:12.50",
          "end": "01:13.80",
          "start_seconds": 72.5,
          "end_seconds": 73.8,
          "duration_seconds": 1.3,
          "text": "Medium shot of Rupert cowering on the altar steps beside Catherine and her father, utterly defeated.",
          "source_line": 150
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_036",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "camera",
          "label": "CAMERA",
          "speaker": null,
          "delivery": null,
          "start": "01:13.80",
          "end": "01:17.80",
          "start_seconds": 73.8,
          "end_seconds": 77.8,
          "duration_seconds": 4.0,
          "text": "Tight close-up on Alexander, his hand resting on the hilt of his sabre as his eyes burn with fierce, cold retribution.",
          "source_line": 154
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "E42_S1_037",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "label": "ALEXANDER (Grim, Vengeful)",
          "speaker": "ALEXANDER",
          "delivery": "Grim, Vengeful",
          "start": "01:13.80",
          "end": "01:17.50",
          "start_seconds": 73.8,
          "end_seconds": 77.5,
          "duration_seconds": 3.7,
          "text": "And now, Rupert... we settle what you stole.",
          "source_line": 158
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
